  "body": "Positioned in the heart of sought-after Half Moon Bay, this property presents an excellent opportunity for developers, investors, or land bankers to secure a prime site in a premium school zone.\r\n\r\nSet on a 668sqm (more or less) freehold section, the property enjoys a desirable reserve-side position with elevated outlooks towards the Tamaki River. That is what is on offer here along with a fabulous location, amazing views and impeccable school zoning.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n· Freehold 668sqm (more or less) land area\r\n· Zoned for Macleans College\r\n· Walking distance to Pigeon Mountain Primary & Bucklands Beach Intermediate\r\n· Generous approx. 370sqm floor area with expansive living\r\n· Solid brick and tile construction\r\n· Five bedrooms, three bathrooms, multiple living areas\r\n· Flexible two-level layout suited to modern family living\r\n· Well-equipped open plan kitchen\r\n· Wrap-around first floor balcony with elevated Tamaki River views\r\n· Positioned next to a reserve with peaceful green outlook\r\n· Close to Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry, beaches, cafés & amenities\r\n\r\nA rare chance to secure a well-located landholding with strong future upside in one of East Auckland’s most desirable coastal pockets.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are increasingly rare — secure a substantial landholding in a premium school zone with strong future upside.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information.",
